WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.410
Signed in as the sender, on a local test stack with invented data.

00:04.410 --> 00:13.540
New envelope: subject, document type Consent (it sets the retention policy), the PDF. Signing order: Riley first, Casey second; Morgan gets a copy (CC).

00:13.540 --> 00:17.880
Fields per signer: signature and date for Riley, signature for Casey.

00:17.880 --> 00:20.200
Review, preview the emails, send.

00:20.200 --> 00:24.730
The local test mailbox: Riley and Morgan have their emails, Casey none yet.

00:24.730 --> 00:28.410
Riley opens the emailed link, signs and adds the date.

00:28.410 --> 00:33.830
On submit the server renders Riley's copy and seals it: PAdES signature, RFC 3161 timestamp.

00:33.830 --> 00:38.740
Casey's email arrives only now, after Riley's signature.

00:38.740 --> 00:42.210
Casey signs from a separate link.

00:42.210 --> 00:48.850
Last signature in: one final PDF with every signature and an audit certificate, sealed and timestamped.

00:48.850 --> 00:53.180
Back as the sender: the envelope is Completed.

00:53.180 --> 00:55.800
The sealed final document is ready to download.
